sp {wizards*apply*ascribe-guess
   (state <s> ^name wizards)
   (<s> ^operator <o>)
   (<o> ^name ascribe-guess)
   (<o> ^|x1| <x1>)
   (<o> ^|x2| <x2>)
   (<o> ^gv <gv>)
-->
